				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="2" xml:lang="la">Optime, frater <lb xml:id="p1z2"/>venerande, de <persName ref="p8055">Blaurero</persName> sentio, tum quod fratres ab eo <lb xml:id="p1z3"/>redeuntes optima quaeque polliceantur et ipse literis<note xml:id="fn1" type="footnote" n="1">Nicht erhalten.</note> ad <lb xml:id="p1z4"/>nos scriptis bene iubeat sperare.</s>
					<s n="3" xml:lang="la">Nihil se mutasse sanct<lb xml:id="p1z5"/>e asseverat in nostra sententia, imo communi veritatis confessione<note xml:id="fn2" type="footnote" n="2">Zur Diskussion um die zwischen <persName ref="p8055">Blarer</persName> und <persName ref="p6469">Erhard Schnepf</persName> zustande gekommene <placeName ref="l572">Württemberger</placeName> Abendmahlskonkordie s. <hi>Köhler,</hi> ZL II 337-355.</note>.</s>
					<s n="4" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z6"/>Sed et <persName ref="p467">Bucerus</persName> idem testatur<note xml:id="fn3" type="footnote" n="3">Siehe <persName ref="p467">Bucer</persName> an <persName ref="p495">Bullinger</persName>, 10. September 1534, oben S. 310-312, 5-42.</note>, testantur hoc et aliarum <lb xml:id="p1z7"/>per <placeName ref="l2481">Sveviam</placeName> ecclesiarum ministri literis<note xml:id="fn4" type="footnote" n="4">Vgl. oben <ref target="file10459">Nr. 424</ref>, 430 und 435.</note> ad me scriptis.</s>
					<s n="5" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z8"/>Venit ad nos nuper vir<note xml:id="fn5" type="footnote" n="5">Der Name dieses ehemaligen <placeName ref="l587">Zürcher</placeName> Pfarrers, der nach <persName ref="p495">Bullingers</persName> Aussage eine wichtige kirchliche Stelle in <placeName ref="l572">Württemberg</placeName> bekleidete, konnte nicht festgestellt werden.</note> et pius et egregie eruditus, <lb xml:id="p1z9"/>qui hactenus in agro <placeName ref="l587">Tigurino</placeName> verbi extitit <lb xml:id="p1z10"/>minister, nunc vero in agro <placeName ref="l572">Cherusco</placeName><note xml:id="fn6" type="footnote" n="6"><placeName ref="l572">Württemberg</placeName>.</note> praefectus est ecclesiae <lb xml:id="p1z11"/>non postremae.</s>
					<s n="6" xml:lang="la">Is miras quasdam in <persName ref="p9708">principe</persName><note xml:id="fn7" type="footnote" n="7">Herzog <persName ref="p9708">Ulrich von Württemberg</persName>.</note> virtutes <lb xml:id="p1z12"/>depraedicabat, asseverabat totum fere nobilium ordinem <lb xml:id="p1z13"/>a partibus stare nostris, se palam praesente <persName ref="p6469">Schnep<lb xml:id="p1z14"/>fio</persName> confessum de eucharistia confessionem nostram, quam <lb xml:id="p1z15"/>aequo is receperit animo.</s>
					<s n="7" xml:lang="la">Scribit <persName ref="p467">Bucerus</persName> <persName ref="p2095">Philippum</persName> <lb xml:id="p1z16"/>amicissime ad se scripsisse<note xml:id="fn8" type="footnote" n="8">Vgl. <persName ref="p2095">Philipp Melanchthon</persName> an <persName ref="p467">Bucer</persName>, 1. August und 16. September 1534, <persName ref="p2095">Melanchthon</persName> BW, Regesten II 146, <ref target="file11511">Nr. 1468</ref> und 156, <ref target="file11536">Nr. 1493</ref>.</note>.</s>
					<s n="8" xml:lang="la"><persName ref="p8055">Blaurerus</persName> alium quidem <lb xml:id="p1z17"/>quam <persName ref="p2301">Osiandrum</persName> vocatum vellet<note xml:id="fn9" type="footnote" n="9">Vgl. oben S. 314, 19f.</note>, sed<note xml:id="fna" type="footnote" n="a"><hi>vor</hi> brevi <hi>gestrichen</hi> paulo.</note><pb type="edition" next="340"/><persName ref="p2095">Philippo</persName> ait nil <lb xml:id="p1z18"/>nobis periculi etc.</s>
					<s n="9" xml:lang="la">Orandus nobis dominus, ut omnia ad <lb xml:id="p1z19"/>gloriam nominis sui evehat.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="10" xml:lang="la">De <persName ref="p467">Buceri</persName> libello<note xml:id="fn10" type="footnote" n="10">Gemeint ist <persName ref="p467">Bucers</persName> «Bericht auß der heyligen geschrift», das im April 1534 bei <persName ref="p4191">Matthias Apiarius</persName> in <placeName ref="l491">Straßburg</placeName> erschienen war (<bibl source="b135">BucerDS</bibl> V 109-258).</note> <lb xml:id="p1z20"/>brevi a respondebimus<note xml:id="fn11" type="footnote" n="11">Siehe <persName ref="p495">Bullingers</persName> Briefe an <persName ref="p467">Bucer</persName> und <persName ref="p8418">Myconius</persName> vom 28. Oktober 1534, unten <ref target="file10501">Nr. 466</ref> und 467.</note>, Mitto nunc Assertionem no<lb xml:id="p1z21"/>stram utriusque in Christo narurae<note xml:id="fn12" type="footnote" n="12"><persName ref="p495">Bullingers</persName> «Assertio utriusque in Christo naturae» erschien in <placeName ref="l587">Zürich</placeName> am 1. Oktober 1534 (<bibl source="b286">HBBibl</bibl> 162; vgl. oben S. 338, 25f).</note>, in cuius calce <lb xml:id="p1z22"/>paucula quaedam annotavimus de eucharistia<note xml:id="fn13" type="footnote" n="13">Siehe <persName ref="p495">Bullinger</persName>, «Assertio ...», aaO, f. 64r.-67v.</note>.</s>
					<s n="11" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z23"/>Obsecro, ut nos tibi in precibus et consiliis habeas commendat<lb xml:id="p1z24"/>os, sed et valentem et Nestoreos viventem in <lb xml:id="p1z25"/>annos<note xml:id="fn14" type="footnote" n="14">Vgl. Adagia, 1, 6, 66 (<bibl source="b370">LB</bibl> II 249); <bibl source="b473">Otto</bibl> 242, Nr. 1223.</note> e thermis rediisse<note xml:id="fn15" type="footnote" n="15"><persName ref="p8418">Myconius</persName> war kurz vor dem 15. September 1534 von einer Badekur zurückgekehrt (s. oben <ref target="file10475">[Nr. 440]</ref> S. 319, Anm. 4).</note> optamus.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="12" xml:lang="la" ana="farewell">Vive et vale, <lb xml:id="p1z26"/>venerande in domino frater.</s>
					<s n="13" xml:lang="la">Nunc non plura potui.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="14" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z27"/><placeName ref="l587">Tiguri</placeName>, 4. octobris 1534.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="15" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z28"/><persName ref="p495">H. Bull[ingerus]</persName> tuus.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<note type="address">[Adresse auf der Rückseite:]</note>
					<s n="16" xml:lang="la"><pb/><lb xml:id="p2z1"/>Domino <persName ref="p8418">Osvaldo Myconio</persName>, <placeName ref="l28">Basileiensis</placeName> <lb xml:id="p2z2"/>ecclesiae antistiti vigilantissimo, fratri in <lb xml:id="p2z3"/>domino plurium observando.</s>
				</p>
			</div>
		</body>
